    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Serious fun, Loose Mushaira, a comedy by Anwar Maqsood, Moin Akhter, Qazi Wajid, Behroze Subzwari, Shehzad Raza and Ishmal was Aga Khan University Cancer Support Group's first fundraising event to raise support for patients in need of chemotherapy but unable to afford it.",
